{
    "title": "Krode Translation(Camera,Text)",
    "description": "When you read foreign books or information, do you find it difficult because of the language barrier? When you travel, do you feel distressed because of the different languages? These problems will be solved after you use Krode Translation!\r\n\r\nKrode Translation is a multi-functional translator that integrates voice, text, pictures, and collection functions. It is a user-centered application with a wider audience and is suitable for users of multiple ages and countries.\r\n\r\nFeature Highlights:\r\n\u2014Supports translating input language into multiple languages\r\n\u2014Quickly translate via voice input\r\n\u2014Recognize text by taking a photo and translate it\r\n\u2014Enter text content for translation\r\n\u2014Supports voice playback of text content\r\n\u2014Translation results can be copied as text",
